WEBVTT

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:00.515
and in cities up and down
the Italian peninsula.

00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:03.518
The authorities were passing laws
about what people could wear,

00:01:03.518 --> 00:01:07.730
sometimes dozens in a single year,

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:10.149
in order to keep up with
ever changing fashions.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:14.112
Now, OK, I imagine you're all thinking,

00:01:14.112 --> 00:01:16.614
well, that's an interesting
history lesson.

00:01:16.614 --> 00:01:19.117
But what does it have to do with us today?

00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:22.995
That's like bloodletting
or trial by ordeal.

00:01:23.037 --> 00:01:28.167
It's not the sort of thing we do
in today's enlightened society.

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:31.420
But actually we do.